nkins GitHub Plugin 1.29.1 及更早版本在 GitHubTokenCredentialsCreator.java 中存在敏感信息泄露漏洞。该漏洞的原理是由于程序未对凭证 ID 进行严格校验，导致攻击者可通过服务端请求伪造（SSRF）漏洞，诱导服务器将存储在 Jenkins 中的敏感凭证发送至攻击者控制的恶意 URL。攻击者仅需通过其他方式获取合法的凭证 ID 并触发相关请求即可实现利用。此漏洞会导致 Jenkins 存储的机密凭证被窃取，严重影响系统安全性。","severity":"HIGH","score":8.8,"aliases":["CVE-2018-1000600"],"sources":["nuclei"],"published":"2018-06-26T17:29:00Z","updated":"2026-06-17T01:32:54Z","remediation":"立即将 Jenkins GitHub Plugin 插件升级到 1.29.2 或更高版本。在升级完成后，建议重新检查并轮换可能已泄露的 GitHub 访问令牌（Tokens）以确保凭证安全。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-29T00:00:00Z","references":["https://jenkins.io/security/advisory/2018-06-25/#SECURITY-915","https://github.com/projectdiscovery/nuclei-templates/blob/main/http/cves/2018/CVE-2018-1000600.yaml","https://github.com/trickest/cve/blob/b3a270a001a31742516eaea5c494f365de9d3c80/2018/CVE-2018-1000600.md","https://github.com/0xMarcio/cve/blob/4d49d726b1fb3c9b2aca31cc43dccec4b6f94cc1/2018/CVE-2018-1000600.md","https://github.com/projectdiscovery/nuclei-templates/blob/9979ce144c257f1c427a75604f8c0ffbc8293390/http/cves/2018/CVE-2018-1000600.yaml","https://github.com/ExpLangcn/NucleiTP/blob/2b7ecb9031a6eda4f272793045f29b339d8e0cce/CVES/high/CVE-2018-1000600.yaml","https://github.com/ExpLangcn/NucleiTP/blob/2b7ecb9031a6eda4f272793045f29b339d8e0cce/CVES/high/cve-2018-1000600-3144.yaml","https://github.com/ExpLangcn/NucleiTP/blob/2b7ecb9031a6eda4f272793045f29b339d8e0cce/CVES/high/cve-2018-1000600-3145.yaml","https://github.com/ExpLangcn/NucleiTP/blob/2b7ecb9031a6eda4f272793045f29b339d8e0cce/CVES/high/cve-2018-1000600-3146.yaml","https://github.com/ExpLangcn/NucleiTP/blob/2b7ecb9031a6eda4f272793045f29b339d8e0cce/CVES/medium/cve-2018-1000600-3147.yaml","https://github.com/shadow1ng/fscan/blob/bf036fd9b272a56d493796badcf0a269f0a83ec0/webscan/pocs/jenkins-cve-2018-1000600.yml","https://github.com/ExpLangcn/NucleiTP/blob/2b7ecb9031a6eda4f272793045f29b339d8e0cce/CVES/high/CVE-2018-1000600_重复副本.yaml"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2018/AVE-2018-0024.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2018-0023","file_name":"2018/AVE-2018-0023.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2018-1000533","title":"GitList ≤0.6 searchTree 函数远程代码执行漏洞","description":"GitList 0.6 及之前版本在 `searchTree` 函数中存在输入过滤不当漏洞（CWE-20），攻击者可利用该漏洞向 `searchTree` 函数传入未经过充分清洗的参数，触发系统命令执行。此漏洞无需身份认证即可利用，攻击者通过向 GitList 搜索表单发送恶意 POST 请求即可触发远程代码执行，获取 Web 服务器 PHP 进程权限。该漏洞影响所有使用 GitList 0.6 及以下版本的系统，可用于搭建挖矿蠕虫或横向渗透服务器。开发者已在 0.7 版本中修复此问题，建议管理员立即升级。","severity":"CRITICAL","score":9.8,"aliases":["CVE-2018-1000533"],"sources":["nuclei"],"published":"2018-06-26T16:29:01Z","updated":"2026-06-17T01:32:51Z","remediation":"tags.<value>立即将 GitList 升级至 0.7 及以上版本，该版本已通过提交 87b8c26b 修复 searchTree 函数中的命令注入漏洞。升级前可临时禁用 GitList 的搜索功能以降低被利用风险。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-29T00:00:00Z","references":["https://github.com/klaussilveira/gitlist/commit/87b8c26b023c3fc37f0796b14bb13710f397b322","https://security.szurek.pl/exploit-bypass-php-escapeshellarg-escapeshellcmd.html","https://github.com/projectdiscovery/nuclei-templates/blob/main/http/cves/2018/CVE-2018-1000533.yaml","https://github.com/trickest/cve/blob/b3a270a001a31742516eaea5c494f365de9d3c80/2018/CVE-2018-1000533.md","https://github.com/vulhub/vulhub/blob/aeaf65793f147f29bd50841ef77f4e9cad07ecc7/gitlist/CVE-2018-1000533/README.md","https://github.com/nomi-sec/PoC-in-GitHub/blob/f7fdc93b8d4d470f2c23e4fffbdda828848b6048/2018/CVE-2018-1000533.json","https://github.com/vulhub/vulhub/blob/aeaf65793f147f29bd50841ef77f4e9cad07ecc7/gitlist/CVE-2018-1000533/README.zh-cn.md","https://github.com/projectdiscovery/nuclei-templates/blob/9979ce144c257f1c427a75604f8c0ffbc8293390/http/cves/2018/CVE-2018-1000533.yaml","https://github.com/ExpLangcn/NucleiTP/blob/2b7ecb9031a6eda4f272793045f29b339d8e0cce/CVES/critical/CVE-2018-1000533.yaml","https://github.com/ExpLangcn/NucleiTP/blob/2b7ecb9031a6eda4f272793045f29b339d8e0cce/CVES/critical/cve-2018-1000533-3142.yaml","https://github.com/ExpLangcn/NucleiTP/blob/2b7ecb9031a6eda4f272793045f29b339d8e0cce/CVES/critical/cve-2018-1000533-3141.yaml","https://github.com/ExpLangcn/NucleiTP/blob/2b7ecb9031a6eda4f272793045f29b339d8e0cce/CVES/critical/cve-2018-1000533-3143.yaml","https://github.com/shadow1ng/fscan/blob/bf036fd9b272a56d493796badcf0a269f0a83ec0/webscan/pocs/gitlist-rce-cve-2018-1000533.yml","https://github.com/dddo0/CVE-2018-1000533"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":["https://raw.githubusercontent.com/adysec/AVE/main/pocs/2018/POC-AVE-2018-0023.toml"],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":true,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2018/AVE-2018-0023.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2018-0049","file_name":"2018/AVE-2018-0049.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2018-10956","title":"IPConfigure Orchid Core VMS 目录遍历漏洞","description":"The user is asking me to fix the `description` field for CVE-2018-10956. Let me analyze the provided information:\n\n1. **NVD Description**: \"IPConfigure Orchid Core VMS 2.0.5 allows Directory Traversal.\"\n2. **CVSS**: 7.5 (HIGH), CVSS:3.0/AV:N/AC:L/PR:N/UI:N/S:U/C:H/I:N/A:N\n3. **CWE**: CWE-22 (Path Traversal)\n4. **Published**: 2018-06-25T15:29:00.253\n5. **Last Modified**: 2026-06-17T01:35:00.460\n6. **ExploitDB PoC**: https://www.exploit-db.com/exploits/44916/ (Metasploit module)\n7. **Nuclei**: https://github.com/projectdiscovery/nuclei-templates/blob/main/http/cves/2018/CVE-2018-10956.yaml\n\nThe description needs to:\n- Be ≥50 words in Chinese\n- Cover: vulnerability principle, impact scope (versions/products), attack conditions (remote/local, authenticated or not)\n- Translate NVD description to flowing Chinese\n- Supplement technical details from local data\n- Not fabricate URLs or specific versions (unless presearch data contains them)\n\nLet me construct a proper Chinese description:\n\n\"IPConfigure Orchid Core VMS 2.0.5 系统存在目录遍历漏洞（CWE-22）。攻击者可通过向目标系统发送包含特殊路径遍历序列（如 `../`）的网络请求，绕过系统验证，直接读取服务器文件系统中的任意敏感文