l 等敏感 URI 路径，限制 Scada 管理界面仅在内网访问，并启用身份认证（HTTP Basic/Digest Auth）防止未授权访问。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-08-02T00:00:00Z","references":["https://github.com/SadFud/Exploits/tree/master/Real%20World/Suites/cir-pwn-life","https://www.exploit-db.com/exploits/45384/","https://www.seebug.org/vuldb/ssvid-97353","https://www.exploit-db.com/exploits/45384","https://github.com/projectdiscovery/nuclei-templates/blob/main/http/cves/2018/CVE-2018-12634.yaml","https://github.com/trickest/cve/blob/7d40e7d94b41c478b4d1a654c7bc3bcf34fa7beb/2018/CVE-2018-12634.md","https://github.com/0xMarcio/cve/blob/5ffa820afafb07e3d2a3856e2c3d1b6e11ccbbaa/2018/CVE-2018-12634.md","https://github.com/projectdiscovery/nuclei-templates/blob/f5a1370a5c99053077d951ed65ac8cc8cef6e9f7/http/cves/2018/CVE-2018-12634.yaml","https://github.com/ExpLangcn/NucleiTP/blob/2b7ecb9031a6eda4f272793045f29b339d8e0cce/CVES/critical/CVE-2018-12634.yaml","https://github.com/ExpLangcn/NucleiTP/blob/2b7ecb9031a6eda4f272793045f29b339d8e0cce/CVES/medium/cve-2018-12634-3253.yaml","https://github.com/ExpLangcn/NucleiTP/blob/2b7ecb9031a6eda4f272793045f29b339d8e0cce/CVES/medium/cve-2018-12634-3251.yaml","https://github.com/ExpLangcn/NucleiTP/blob/2b7ecb9031a6eda4f272793045f29b339d8e0cce/CVES/critical/cve-2018-12634-3252.yaml","https://github.com/ExpLangcn/NucleiTP/blob/2b7ecb9031a6eda4f272793045f29b339d8e0cce/CVES/critical/cve-2018-12634-3255.yaml","https://github.com/ExpLangcn/NucleiTP/blob/2b7ecb9031a6eda4f272793045f29b339d8e0cce/CVES/critical/CVE-2018-12634_重复副本.yaml","https://github.com/GhostTroops/scan4all/blob/fff03b51bf79c8993a46c1da766ec993e1102c47/config/51pwn/CVE-2018-12634.yaml"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":["https://raw.githubusercontent.com/adysec/AVE/main/pocs/2018/POC-AVE-2018-0072.toml"],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":true,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2018/AVE-2018-0072.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2018-0071","file_name":"2018/AVE-2018-0071.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2018-12613","title":"phpMyAdmin phpMyAdmin 本地文件包含漏洞","description":"phpMyAdmin 4.8.1 及之前版本的 checkPageValidity 函数存在白名单验证缺陷，导致任意文件包含漏洞。攻击者可通过构造恶意参数绕过页面重定向的白名单检查，在服务器上包含并执行任意文件。该漏洞影响所有启用 phpMyAdmin 的环境，CVSS 评分 8.8（高危）。攻击条件通常需要身份认证，但当配置 $cfg['AllowArbitraryServer'] = true 或 $cfg['ServerDefault'] = 0 时，攻击者可无需认证直接利用，前者允许指定任意受控主机执行代码，后者绕过登录直接运行易受攻击代码。利用方式为发送特制 HTTP 请求操控页面加载参数，实现文件包含进而获取服务器控制权。","severity":"HIGH","score":8.8,"aliases":["CVE-2018-12613"],"sources":["nuclei"],"published":"2018-06-21T20:29:00Z","updated":"2026-06-17T01:38:03Z","remediation":"立即升级 phpMyAdmin 至 4.8.2 或更高版本（官网下载 https://www.phpmyadmin.net/downloads/）。若暂时无法升级，请在 config.inc.php 中设置 $cfg['AllowArbitraryServer'] = false 并 $cfg['ServerDefault'] = 1 禁用任意服务器连接与零默认服务器模式，同时在 Web 服务器层面限制 phpMyAdmin 访问来源 IP 或启用强制 HTTPS 与强密码策略作为临时缓解。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-08-02T00:00:00Z","references":["http://packetstormsecurity.com/files/164623/phpMyAdmin-4.8.1-Remote-Code-Execution.html","http://www.securityfocus.com/bid/104532","https://security.gentoo.org/glsa/201904-16","https://www.exploit-db.com/exploits/44924/","https://www.exploit-db.com/exploits/44928/","https://www.exploit-db.com/exploits/45020/","https://www.phpmyadmin.net/security/PMASA-2018-4/","https://www.exploit-db.com/exploits/50457","https://github.com/projectdiscovery/nuclei-templates/blob/main/http/cves/2018/CVE-2018-12613.yaml","https://github.com/trickest/cve/blob/7d40e7d94b41c478b4d1a654c7bc3bcf34fa7beb/2018/CVE-2018-12613.md","https://github.com/ExpLangcn/NucleiTP/blob/2b7ecb9031a6eda4f272793045f29b339d8e0cce/CVES/high/CVE-2018-12613.yaml","https://github.com/ExpLangcn/NucleiTP/blob/2b7ecb9031a6eda4f272793045f29b339d8e0cce/CVES/high/cve-2018-12613-3248.yaml","https://github.com/ExpLangcn/NucleiTP/blob/2b7ecb9031a6eda4f272793045f29b339d8e0cce/CVES/critical/cve-2018-12613-3250.yaml","https://github.com/wgpsec/AboutSecurity/blob/f3c8574e6fa1f9c1cd5aeaba5a209af796107b34/Vuln/middleware/phpmyadmin/CVE-2018-12613.md","https://github.com/SleepingBag945/dddd/blob/4c428a7c171275bfbb5fa72c2fb4bd7b48f4ff4a/common/config/pocs/CVE-2018-12613.yaml","https://github.com/sepehrdaddev/zap-scripts/blob/2b63b02ca79cc7f0023cdbab72c5c6c774354b07/active/CVE-2018-12613.js","https://github.com/CVEDB/Poc-Git/blob/0275aeb329b0747c9a1d46160c921eae06095557/2018/CVE-2018-12613.md","https://github.com/cckuailong/reapoc/blob/699762e4c31d0183733f64313d8fc3be6470bd37/2018/CVE-2018-12613/vultarget/README.md","https://github.com/awake1t/linglong/blob/bedbe49597412abab1c1635e133957d782e65325/pkg/pocs/phpmyadmin-cve-2018-12613-file-inclusion.yml","https://github.com/YagamiiLight/Cerberus","https://github.com/0x00-0x00/CVE-2018-12613","https://github.com/ivanitlearning/CVE-2018-12613","https://github.com/eastmountyxz/CVE-2018-12613-phpMyAdmin"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2018/AVE-2018-0071.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2018-0215","file_name":"2018/AVE-2018-0215.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2018-8727","title":"Mirasys DVMS Workstation Gateway 路径遍历漏洞","description":"Mirasys DVMS Workstation 5.12.6及更早版本的Gateway组件存在路径遍历漏洞（CWE-22）。未经身份认证的远程攻击者可通过Web Client webserver向目标系统发送特制的HTTP请求，利用../序列遍历文件系统目录，从而读取服务器上的任意文件。该漏洞影响Mirasys DVMS Workstation系列监控管理系统，CVSS评分7.5，危害等级高。攻击无需任何权限，仅需网络可达即可利用，可能导致敏感配置信息泄露，为后续攻击提供跳板。厂商已发布安全更新修复此漏洞。","severity":"HIGH","score":7.5,"aliases":["CVE-2018-8727"],"sources":["nuclei"],"published":"2018-06-19T19:29:00Z","updated":"2026-06-17T02:05:18Z","remediation":"升级 Mirasys DVMS Workstation 至 5.12.7 或更高版本。如无法立即升级，在 Web 客户端所在服务器上配置 Web 应用防火墙（WAF）规则，拦截包含 `../` 及 `.../` 等路径遍历特征的 HTTP 请求；同时限制 Web 客户端仅允许受信任 IP 访问，并禁用不必要的文件共享功能以降低攻击面。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-08-03T00:00:00Z","references":["https://www.onvio.nl/nieuws/cve-mirasys-vulnerability","https://github.com/projectdiscovery/nuclei-templates/blob/main/http/cves/2018/CVE-2018-8727.yaml","https://github.com/trickest/cve/blob/7ade3449b58b8e2c679712dc3af64bbd8e638364/2018/CVE-2018-8727.md","https://github.com/projectdiscovery/nuclei-templates/blob/e9f0fe7fa4f5c548bbd1a4d3b65d0f181021e664/http/cves/2018/CVE-2018-8727.yaml","https://github.com/ExpLangcn/NucleiTP/blob/2b7ecb9031a6eda4f272793045f29b339d8e0cce/CVES/high/CVE-2018-8727.yaml","https://github.com/ExpLangcn/NucleiTP/blob/2b7ecb9031a6eda4f272793045f29b339d8e0cce/CVES/high/cve-2018-8727-3645.yaml","https://github.com/ExpLangcn/NucleiTP/blob/2b7ecb9031a6eda4f272793045f29b339d8e0cce/CVES/high/cve-2018-8727-3643.yaml","https://github.com/ExpLangcn/NucleiTP/blob/2b7ecb9031a6eda4f272793045f29b339d8e0cce/CVES/high/cve-2018-8727-3644.yaml","https://github.com/ExpLangcn/NucleiTP/blob/2b7ecb9031a6eda4f272793045f29b339d8e0cce/CVES/high/cve-2018-8727-3646.yaml","https://github.com/GhostTroops/scan4all/blob/fff03b51bf79c8993a46c1da766ec993e1102c47/config/51pwn/TPALL/LFI/CVE-2018-8727.yaml","https://github.com/GhostTroops/scan4all/blob/fff03b51bf79c8993a46c1da766ec993e1102c47/config/51pwn/yaml/Mirasys DVMS Worlstation/CVE-2018-8727.yaml","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/c6e3b04088d3a34fb448e0c7ffd377395dcc3ef8/cves/2018/8xxx/CVE-2018-8727.json"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":["https://raw.githubusercontent.com/adysec/AVE/main/pocs/2018/POC-AVE-2018-0215.toml"],"repo_exp_urls":["https://raw.githubusercontent.com/adysec/AVE/main/exploits/2018/EXP-AVE-2018-0215.toml"],"has_poc":true,"has_exp":true,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2018/AVE-2018-0215.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2018-0051","file_name":"2018/AVE-2018-0051.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2018-11222","title":"Artica Pandora FMS 本地文件包含漏洞","description":"Artica Pandora FMS 7.23 及之前版本的 /pandora_console/ajax.php AJAX 端点存在本地文件包含漏洞，攻击者可通过构造恶意参数调用任意 PHP 文件，导致远程代码执行或敏感文件读取。该漏洞影响 Artica Pandora FMS 7.23 及之前所有版本，CVSS 3.0 评分 7.5（HIGH），攻击向量为网络，攻击复杂度低，无需权限和用户交互，机密性影响高。攻击者可直接向 /pandora_console/ajax.php 发送包含文件包含参数的恶意请求，利用输入验证缺陷包含并执行服务器上的任意 PHP 文件，从而获取服务器控制权限或窃取敏感数据。Artica 已在后续版本中修复该漏洞，建议用户升级至最新版本。","severity":"HIGH","score":7.5,"aliases":["CVE-2018-11222"],"sources":["nuclei"],"published":"2018-06-16T01:29:05Z","updated":"2026-06-17T01:35:31Z","remediation":"建议立即升级 Artica Pandora FMS 至 7.24 或更高版本（官方已修复该 LFI 漏洞）。如暂无法升级，可通过 Web 服务器配置禁用 /pandora_console/ajax.php 接口的 PHP 文件包含功能，或在 Web 应用防火墙层面拦截包含 ../ 等路径遍历特征的请求作为临时缓解措施。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-30T00:00:00Z","references":["https://blog.hackercat.ninja/post/pandoras_box/","https://pandorafms.com/wp-content/uploads/2018/06/whats-new-723-EN.pdf","https://github.com/projectdiscovery/nuclei-templates/blob/main/http/cves/2018/CVE-2018-11222.yaml","https://github.com/trickest/cve/blob/b349e2ac98435c78e6eec698cf95df82dacb0ca1/2018/CVE-2018-11222.md","https://github.com/projectdiscovery/nuclei-templates/blob/9979ce144c257f1c427a75604f8c0ffbc8293390/http/cves/2018/CVE-2018-11222.yaml","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/4d40bbb471811a29843f023fbf1a8beb3373a987/cves/2018/11xxx/CVE-2018-11222.json","https://github.com/0x727/FingerprintHub/blob/1ca878524ec242a39629a3704532139917779e9c/plugins/artica/pandora_fms/CVE-2018-11222.yaml","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/8badb38e9fdd060ee46b7da7005f556b6f7db6bb/CVE/data/2018/CVE-2018-11222.json","https://github.com/ARPSyndicate/suricata-vedas/blob/fe24794ad36564b5bbc7c69101525011387b8650/2018/CVE-2018-11222.rules","https://github.com/adampielak/nuclei-templates/blob/a2f3ff3fa5db5c7705ebd942909ec114df063700/nuclei-v3/C/CVE-2018-11222.yaml","https://github.com/youki992/VscanPlus/blob/714a0e276a538a22c1a6215c71458a8b59a920ef/pocs_yml/nucleiFiles/http/cves/2018/CVE-2018-11222.yaml","https://github.com/lianqingsec/NucleiPocGather/blob/dcce204f62196117b9c95c52d8101ccf7a5d27bc/poc/cve/CVE-2018-11222.yaml","https://github.com/runZeroInc/nuclei-templates/blob/2942bc444541fb9531f613dc3e56380271e522b3/http/cves/2018/CVE-2018-11222.yaml"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2018/AVE-2018-0051.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2018-0908","file_name":"2018/AVE-2018-0908.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2018-6961","title":"VMware NSX SD-WAN Edge 命令注入漏洞","description":"VMware NSX SD-WAN Edge（原 VeloCloud）的本地 Web UI 组件存在 OS 命令注入漏洞（CWE-78）。该组件默认处于禁用状态，但当管理员手动启用后，未经身份认证的远程攻击者可通过向受影响组件的输入参数中注入恶意操作系统命令，利用该漏洞在目标设备上以 root 权限执行任意命令，导致远程代码执行。攻击者无需认证即可利用，但需要目标启用该组件且攻击复杂度较高（需网络可达）。VMware 已在 3.1.0 版本中修复此漏洞，并计划在后续版本中彻底移除该服务。","severity":"HIGH","score":8.1,"aliases":["CVE-2018-6961"],"sources":["nuclei"],"published":"2018-06-11T22:29:00Z","updated":"2026-06-17T02:02:31Z","remediation":"立即将 VMware NSX SD-WAN Edge by VeloCloud 升级至 3.1.0 或更高版本。该漏洞存在于 local web UI 组件中，该组件默认处于禁用状态，请确认该组件未被手动启用；如已启用，立即禁用并在防火墙上限制仅可信管理 IP 访问 9443 端口。如无法立即升级，确保 local web UI 组件处于禁用状态，并在网络边界阻断对该端口的非授权访问作为临时缓解措施。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-08-03T00:00:00Z","references":["http://www.securityfocus.com/bid/104185","http://www.securitytracker.com/id/1041210","http://www.vmware.com/security/advisories/VMSA-2018-0011.html","https://www.exploit-db.com/exploits/44959/","https://www.cisa.gov/known-exploited-vulnerabilities-catalog?field_cve=CVE-2018-6961","https://www.exploit-db.com/exploits/44959","https://github.com/projectdiscovery/nuclei-templates/blob/main/http/cves/2018/CVE-2018-6961.yaml","https://github.com/trickest/cve/blob/7ade3449b58b8e2c679712dc3af64bbd8e638364/2018/CVE-2018-6961.md","https://github.com/nomi-sec/PoC-in-GitHub/blob/ab6f9d01ebd789d88d6c9c80d2c4801a89e1f38f/2018/CVE-2018-6961.json","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/b37ddadc32d456372cb07846a95b411ce7a32d9f/cves/2018/6xxx/CVE-2018-6961.json","https://github.com/cisagov/vulnrichment/blob/380f533205c12eeaa5a8c27e3ae790586a72a402/2018/6xxx/CVE-2018-6961.json","https://github.com/0x727/FingerprintHub/blob/5784554659c9500df8525e8db4f986630a56d8a1/plugins/vmware/nsx_sd-wan_edge/CVE-2018-6961.yaml","https://github.com/CVEDB/Poc-Git/blob/0275aeb329b0747c9a1d46160c921eae06095557/2018/CVE-2018-6961.md","https://github.com/kaismax/CVE-Poc/blob/6d8c93dabf674cea102713781cc534d577412357/2018/CVE-2018-6961.md","https://github.com/rix4uni/cvemapping/blob/23441ec855d45e03157b693d7c6d0ff023fe3af5/2018/CVE-2018-6961/CVE-2018-6961.py","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/37be0559d0574b93d433d6c01d9f77ea4c420519/CVE/data/2018/CVE-2018-6961.json","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/37be0559d0574b93d433d6c01d9f77ea4c420519/SSVC/data/2018/CVE-2018-6961.json","https://github.com/r3dxpl0it/CVE-2018-6961","https://github.com/bokanrb/CVE-2018-6961"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":["https://raw.githubusercontent.com/adysec/AVE/main/pocs/2018/POC-AVE-2018-0908.toml"],"repo_exp_urls":["https://raw.githubusercontent.com/adysec/AVE/main/exploits/2018/EXP-AVE-2018-0908.toml"],"has_poc":true,"has_exp":true,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2018/AVE-2018-0908.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2018-0065","file_name":"2018/AVE-2018-0065.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2018-12095","title":"易创 Oecms 3.1 信息页面跨站脚本攻击","description":"OEcms 3.1 版本的 info.php 文件中 mod 参数存在反射型跨站脚本漏洞，由于对用户输入的 mod 参数缺乏充分过滤和转义，攻击者可构造包含恶意 JavaScript 代码的 URL 诱导受害者点击。当用户访问该链接时，恶意脚本将在受害者浏览器中执行，可窃取 Cookie、会话令牌或执行其他敏感操作。该漏洞影响 OEcms 3.1 版本，攻击条件为用户需点击恶意链接且浏览器未开启 XSS 防护，CVSS 评分 5.4 为中危等级。","severity":"MEDIUM","score":5.4,"aliases":["CVE-2018-12095"],"sources":["nuclei"],"published":"2018-06-11T11:29:00Z","updated":"2026-06-17T01:37:08Z","remediation":"立即将 Oecms 升级到 4.0 或更高版本，应用核心安全补丁并重新编译；在 info.php 中启用严格的输入验证和出码过滤，关闭 PHP 错误显示，配置 Content-Type 为 text/html 并添加 X-Content-Type-Options: nosniff 等安全 HTTP 头以缓解 XSS 风险。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-08-02T00:00:00Z","references":["https://cxsecurity.com/issue/WLB-2018060092","https://www.exploit-db.com/exploits/44895/","https://www.exploit-db.com/exploits/44895","https://github.com/projectdiscovery/nuclei-templates/blob/main/http/cves/2018/CVE-2018-12095.yaml","https://github.com/trickest/cve/blob/34a9e13075452733bcb91f2f69cce2906587662c/2018/CVE-2018-12095.md","https://github.com/projectdiscovery/nuclei-templates/blob/f5a1370a5c99053077d951ed65ac8cc8cef6e9f7/http/cves/2018/CVE-2018-12095.yaml","https://github.com/ExpLangcn/NucleiTP/blob/2b7ecb9031a6eda4f272793045f29b339d8e0cce/CVES/medium/CVE-2018-12095.yaml","https://github.com/ExpLangcn/NucleiTP/blob/2b7ecb9031a6eda4f272793045f29b339d8e0cce/CVES/medium/cve-2018-12095-3233.yaml","https://github.com/ExpLangcn/NucleiTP/blob/2b7ecb9031a6eda4f272793045f29b339d8e0cce/CVES/medium/cve-2018-12095-3231.yaml","https://github.com/GhostTroops/scan4all/blob/fff03b51bf79c8993a46c1da766ec993e1102c47/config/51pwn/yaml/OECMS/CVE-2018-12095.yaml","https://github.com/SleepingBag945/dddd/blob/4c428a7c171275bfbb5fa72c2fb4bd7b48f4ff4a/common/config/pocs/CVE-2018-12095.yaml","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/fd4c668e0b43bf25cada98d9b000adcf7f4c176f/cves/2018/12xxx/CVE-2018-12095.json","https://github.com/sepehrdaddev/zap-scripts/blob/2b63b02ca79cc7f0023cdbab72c5c6c774354b07/active/CVE-2018-12095.js","https://github.com/veo/vscan/blob/1beb10c08e377e15b7dd417be1843bb75aa8c4f0/pocs_yml/nucleiFiles/cves/2018/CVE-2018-12095.yaml"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2018/AVE-2018-0065.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2018-0063","file_name":"2018/AVE-2018-0063.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2018-12054","title":"Schools Alert Management Script 任意文件读取漏洞","description":"Schools Alert Management Script 存在绝对路径遍历漏洞，攻击者可通过向存在漏洞的页面发送构造的特制请求，利用路径遍历技术读取服务器上的任意文件，导致敏感信息泄露。该漏洞影响 Schools Alert Management Script 相关版本，攻击条件为需要能够访问该 Web 应用的网络接口，无需特殊权限即可利用。攻击者可结合泄露的配置文件、数据库凭据等敏感信息进一步扩大攻击面，危害较大。该漏洞已有公开利用方法，ExploitDB 已收录编号为 44874 的利用代码，建议受影响用户及时更新补丁或限制对相关页面的访问。","severity":"MEDIUM","score":5.0,"aliases":["CVE-2018-12054"],"sources":["nuclei"],"published":"2018-06-09T00:00:00Z","updated":"2018-06-09T00:00:00Z","remediation":"建议立即弃用该脚本并迁移至其他仍在维护的校园告警管理解决方案，因官方已停止维护、无补丁可升级；若必须临时使用，应在 img.php 等文件读取入口对 view 参数实施白名单校验，仅允许读取站点固定目录内的文件，并拒绝包含 ../、..\\/ 及以 / 开头的绝对路径输入；同时在 Web 服务器层禁用目录遍历访问，并通过 WAF 或重写规则拦截路径穿越载荷，最小化 Web 进程权限并限制其可读目录。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-08-02T00:00:00Z","references":["https://www.exploit-db.com/exploits/44874","https://github.com/projectdiscovery/nuclei-templates/blob/main/http/cves/2018/CVE-2018-12054.yaml","https://github.com/unh3x/just4cve/issues/4","https://www.exploit-db.com/exploits/44874/","https://github.com/trickest/cve/blob/34a9e13075452733bcb91f2f69cce2906587662c/2018/CVE-2018-12054.md","https://github.com/projectdiscovery/nuclei-templates/blob/f5a1370a5c99053077d951ed65ac8cc8cef6e9f7/http/cves/2018/CVE-2018-12054.yaml","https://github.com/ExpLangcn/NucleiTP/blob/2b7ecb9031a6eda4f272793045f29b339d8e0cce/CVES/high/CVE-2018-12054.yaml","https://github.com/ExpLangcn/NucleiTP/blob/2b7ecb9031a6eda4f272793045f29b339d8e0cce/CVES/high/cve-2018-12054-3224.yaml","https://github.com/ExpLangcn/NucleiTP/blob/2b7ecb9031a6eda4f272793045f29b339d8e0cce/CVES/high/cve-2018-12054-3223.yaml","https://github.com/ExpLangcn/NucleiTP/blob/2b7ecb9031a6eda4f272793045f29b339d8e0cce/CVES/high/cve-2018-12054-3226.yaml","https://github.com/GhostTroops/scan4all/blob/fff03b51bf79c8993a46c1da766ec993e1102c47/config/51pwn/yaml/Schools Alert Management Script/CVE-2018-12054.yaml","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/e409cc3aa72de0994d4d1b2baf38bcac39a42cdc/cves/2018/12xxx/CVE-2018-12054.json","https://github.com/sepehrdaddev/zap-scripts/blob/2b63b02ca79cc7f0023cdbab72c5c6c774354b07/active/CVE-2018-12054.js","https://github.com/veo/vscan/blob/1beb10c08e377e15b7dd417be1843bb75aa8c4f0/pocs_yml/nucleiFiles/cves/2018/CVE-2018-12054.yaml"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2018/AVE-2018-0063.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2018-0054","file_name":"2018/AVE-2018-0054.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2018-11409","title":"Splunk Server-Info 信息泄露漏洞","description":"Splunk 7.0.1 及之前版本的 server-info 端点存在信息泄露漏洞，源于该端点缺乏访问控制检查。未经身份认证的远程攻击者可向目标 Splunk 实例发送包含 `__raw/services/server/info/server-info?output_mode=json` 参数的 HTTP 请求，直接获取服务器敏感信息（如许可证密钥、版本号、构建号等配置详情）。该漏洞影响 Splunk 7.0.1 及更早版本，攻击者无需身份认证、无需用户交互即可远程利用，CVSS 3.0 评分 5.3（中危），主要影响机密性。Splunk 已在 7.0.2 版本中修复该漏洞，建议用户升级至 7.0.2 或更高版本并限制管理端口访问。","severity":"MEDIUM","score":5.3,"aliases":["CVE-2018-11409"],"sources":["nuclei"],"published":"2018-06-08T12:29:00Z","updated":"2026-06-17T01:35:52Z","remediation":"建议立即升级 Splunk 至 7.0.2 或更高版本（官方已在 7.0.2 修复该信息泄漏漏洞）。若暂时无法升级，可在 Web 服务器或防火墙层面配置规则拦截包含 __raw/services/server/info/server-info 路径的请求，或在 Splunk Web 配置中限制对 /services/server/info/server-info 端点的匿名访问权限。同时建议轮换可能已泄露的许可证密钥等敏感信息。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-30T00:00:00Z","references":["http://www.securitytracker.com/id/1041148","https://github.com/kofa2002/splunk","https://www.exploit-db.com/exploits/44865/","https://www.exploit-db.com/exploits/44865","https://github.com/projectdiscovery/nuclei-templates/blob/main/http/cves/2018/CVE-2018-11409.yaml","https://github.com/trickest/cve/blob/b349e2ac98435c78e6eec698cf95df82dacb0ca1/2018/CVE-2018-11409.md","https://github.com/projectdiscovery/nuclei-templates/blob/9979ce144c257f1c427a75604f8c0ffbc8293390/http/cves/2018/CVE-2018-11409.yaml","https://github.com/ExpLangcn/NucleiTP/blob/2b7ecb9031a6eda4f272793045f29b339d8e0cce/CVES/medium/CVE-2018-11409.yaml","https://github.com/ExpLangcn/NucleiTP/blob/2b7ecb9031a6eda4f272793045f29b339d8e0cce/CVES/medium/cve-2018-11409-3194.yaml","https://github.com/ExpLangcn/NucleiTP/blob/2b7ecb9031a6eda4f272793045f29b339d8e0cce/CVES/medium/cve-2018-11409-3193.yaml","https://github.com/ExpLangcn/NucleiTP/blob/2b7ecb9031a6eda4f272793045f29b339d8e0cce/CVES/medium/cve-2018-11409-3191.yaml","https://github.com/ExpLangcn/NucleiTP/blob/2b7ecb9031a6eda4f272793045f29b339d8e0cce/CVES/medium/cve-2018-11409-3195.yaml","https://github.com/ExpLangcn/NucleiTP/blob/2b7ecb9031a6eda4f272793045f29b339d8e0cce/CVES/medium/cve-2018-11409-3190.yaml","https://github.com/GhostTroops/scan4all/blob/fff03b51bf79c8993a46c1da766ec993e1102c47/config/51pwn/CVE-2018-11409.yaml","https://github.com/GhostTroops/scan4all/blob/fff03b51bf79c8993a46c1da766ec993e1102c47/config/51pwn/TPALL/medium/CVE-2018-11409.yaml"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2018/AVE-2018-0054.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2018-0029","file_name":"2018/AVE-2018-0029.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2018-10088","title":"雄迈 uc-httpd 缓冲区溢出漏洞","description":"雄迈科技（XiongMai）uc-httpd 1.0.0 是一款轻量级 HTTP 服务器，广泛部署于雄迈系列网络摄像头、DVR、NVR 等安防设备的 Web 管理界面中。该版本存在缓冲区溢出漏洞（CWE-119），攻击者无需身份认证即可远程触发。当服务器处理特制的超长 HTTP 请求——如过长的 URI、查询字符串或 Cookie——时，由于缺乏适当的边界检查，数据写入缓冲区时发生溢出并覆盖相邻内存区域，进而可导致任意代码执行。该漏洞利用复杂度低（AC:L），无需用户交互，攻击者仅需向目标设备的 Web 端口（通常为 80 或 443 端口）发送精心构造的超长数据请求即可触发溢出并获得设备的完整控制权。此漏洞与 CVE-2017-16725 为不同的安全缺陷。受影响的安防设备一旦被利用，攻击者可植入固件后门、篡改设备配置或以内网为跳板发起横向移动，对监控网络和用户隐私构成严重安全威胁。","severity":"CRITICAL","score":9.8,"aliases":["CVE-2018-10088"],"sources":["nuclei"],"published":"2018-06-08T12:29:00Z","updated":"2026-06-17T01:33:28Z","remediation":"升级XiongMai uc-httpd至1.0.0以上版本，从XiongMai官网下载最新固件并刷写受影响的DVR/IP摄像设备。若暂时无法获取修复版本，可在网络边界防火墙上禁止外部网络对设备Web管理端口（默认80/443）的访问，仅放行受信任的管理IP段，或直接禁用uc-httpd远程Web管理服务以缓解攻击风险。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-29T00:00:00Z","references":["https://github.com/bitfu/uc-httpd-1.0.0-buffer-overflow-exploit","https://www.exploit-db.com/exploits/44864/","https://www.exploit-db.com/exploits/44864","https://github.com/projectdiscovery/nuclei-templates/blob/main/http/cves/2018/CVE-2018-10088.yaml","https://github.com/trickest/cve/blob/b3a270a001a31742516eaea5c494f365de9d3c80/2018/CVE-2018-10088.md","https://github.com/projectdiscovery/nuclei-templates/blob/9979ce144c257f1c427a75604f8c0ffbc8293390/http/cves/2018/CVE-2018-10088.yaml","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/ab00a662168d29727ed07327ed7248857f064d23/cves/2018/10xxx/CVE-2018-10088.json","https://github.com/trickest/cve/blob/b3a270a001a31742516eaea5c494f365de9d3c80/2022/CVE-2022-45460.md","https://github.com/0x727/FingerprintHub/blob/1ca878524ec242a39629a3704532139917779e9c/plugins/xiongmaitech/uc-httpd/CVE-2018-10088.yaml","https://github.com/CVEDB/Poc-Git/blob/0275aeb329b0747c9a1d46160c921eae06095557/2018/CVE-2018-10088.md","https://github.com/kaismax/CVE-Poc/blob/6d8c93dabf674cea102713781cc534d577412357/2018/CVE-2018-10088.md","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/e52b937328f58a3e9a1e7e8e4c1ac9025c3099d3/CVE/data/2018/CVE-2018-10088.json","https://github.com/ARPSyndicate/suricata-vedas/blob/fe24794ad36564b5bbc7c69101525011387b8650/2018/CVE-2018-10088.rules","https://github.com/adampielak/nuclei-templates/blob/a2f3ff3fa5db5c7705ebd942909ec114df063700/nuclei-v3/C/CVE-2018-10088.yaml"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":["https://raw.githubusercontent.com/adysec/AVE/main/pocs/2018/POC-AVE-2018-0029.toml"],"repo_exp_urls":["https://raw.githubusercontent.com/adysec/AVE/main/exploits/2018/EXP-AVE-2018-0029.toml"],"has_poc":true,"has_exp":true,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2018/AVE-2018-0029.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2018-0062","file_name":"2018/AVE-2018-0062.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2018-12031","title":"Eaton Intelligent Power Manager 文件包含漏洞","description":"Eaton Intelligent Power Manager v1.6 的 server/node_upgrade_srv.js 接口存在本地文件包含漏洞（CWE-22）。未经身份认证的远程攻击者可在无需用户交互的情况下，通过 downloadFirmware 操作的 firmware 参数利用目录遍历，向服务器发送特制请求以包含或读取任意系统文件。该漏洞影响采用 Eaton Intelligent Power Manager v1.6 的能源管理及数据中心电源监控系统，由于无需认证且攻击复杂度低，攻击者可直接通过网络远程利用，可能导致敏感配置文件、凭据或其他系统文件泄露，进而造成严重的信息安全风险。CVSS 评分 9.8，危害等级严重。建议升级至安全版本并限制相关接口的网络访问权限。","severity":"CRITICAL","score":9.8,"aliases":["CVE-2018-12031"],"sources":["nuclei"],"published":"2018-06-07T16:29:00Z","updated":"2026-06-17T01:37:02Z","remediation":"Eaton 官方已发布补丁版本修复此漏洞，建议将 Intelligent Power Manager 立即升级至 1.7 或更高版本。升级前请备份所有配置文件和电源管理策略，安装新版本后重新导入配置并验证固件下载功能正常。如暂时无法升级，可临时禁用 node_upgrade_srv.js 中的 firmware 参数调用，或在反向代理层配置 WAF 规则阻断包含 \"../\" 或 \"%2e%2e\" 的 request URI，以阻止目录遍历攻击。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-30T00:00:00Z","references":["https://github.com/EmreOvunc/Eaton-Intelligent-Power-Manager-Local-File-Inclusion","https://github.com/projectdiscovery/nuclei-templates/blob/main/http/cves/2018/CVE-2018-12031.yaml","https://github.com/trickest/cve/blob/e6bcead746c2adeb753bca023a78deabe048138b/2018/CVE-2018-12031.md","https://github.com/nomi-sec/PoC-in-GitHub/blob/22733980d8b03918f7c2a90dcfcf1e099382cf16/2018/CVE-2018-12031.json","https://github.com/projectdiscovery/nuclei-templates/blob/6a937552e9f3ac3acbe1d9854cb9d3888cc4af04/http/cves/2018/CVE-2018-12031.yaml","https://github.com/ExpLangcn/NucleiTP/blob/2b7ecb9031a6eda4f272793045f29b339d8e0cce/CVES/critical/CVE-2018-12031.yaml","https://github.com/ExpLangcn/NucleiTP/blob/2b7ecb9031a6eda4f272793045f29b339d8e0cce/CVES/critical/cve-2018-12031-3220.yaml","https://github.com/ExpLangcn/NucleiTP/blob/2b7ecb9031a6eda4f272793045f29b339d8e0cce/CVES/critical/cve-2018-12031-3222.yaml","https://github.com/ExpLangcn/NucleiTP/blob/2b7ecb9031a6eda4f272793045f29b339d8e0cce/CVES/critical/cve-2018-12031-3221.yaml","https://github.com/GhostTroops/scan4all/blob/fff03b51bf79c8993a46c1da766ec993e1102c47/config/51pwn/CVE-2018-12031.yaml","https://github.com/GhostTroops/scan4all/blob/fff03b51bf79c8993a46c1da766ec993e1102c47/config/51pwn/yaml/Eaton Intelligent Power Manager/CVE-2018-12031.yaml","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/f65e788e68f69ba62438322359adcbf3bb4896d2/cves/2018/12xxx/CVE-2018-12031.json"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2018/AVE-2018-0062.toml"}]